      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Both \"triumph and values\" and \"injustice and power\" are valid and necessary\n\n  \n\n\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \n  \"\n  \"\n  \"\n  \"",
      "source": "target",
      "reasoning": "\n\n"
